{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e08-scene-03",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "俺はあんたとは絶対に組まん  (I Will Never Team Up With You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "ikezawa": "池沢",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a quiet ramen counter, rival mogul Ikezawa offers Muranishi one billion yen in production financing if he hands over his studio and distribution rights, sparking a fierce clash of philosophies. Listen for \"yuushi\", business financing or a loan.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "おかえり。出所祝いだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "早く用件を言ってくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "実はな、お前の会社を買い取りたいと思ってんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ふざけてるのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "十億融資してやる。そのかわり販売はすべてうちがやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "二度とないチャンスだぞ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はあんたとは絶対に組まん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うちとお前らじゃ資金力が違う。勝算はないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は彼女じゃなくても最高の作品を作れる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんたも変わらんな。まだ生ぬるい偽物作ってるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "時代の流れを読めるからここまで来られたんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうだろうな。俺はしつこいからな。ごちそうさん。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "おかえり。出所祝いだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome back. Consider this a release celebration.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "早く用件を言ってくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just tell me your business already.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "実はな、お前の会社を買い取りたいと思ってんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truth is, I am thinking about buying out your studio.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ふざけてるのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you joking with me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "十億融資してやる。そのかわり販売はすべてうちがやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will finance you with one billion yen, and in return we handle all distribution.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "二度とないチャンスだぞ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance, you know?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はあんたとは絶対に組まん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will never team up with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うちとお前らじゃ資金力が違う。勝算はないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our capital is on a different level from yours. You have no chance of winning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は彼女じゃなくても最高の作品を作れる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even without Kuroki, I can make the greatest films.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんたも変わらんな。まだ生ぬるい偽物作ってるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You haven't changed either. Still shooting lukewarm fakes, aren't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "時代の流れを読めるからここまで来られたんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I made it this far because I know how to read the flow of the times.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうだろうな。俺はしつこいからな。ごちそうさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will see about that. I am pretty persistent. Thanks for the meal.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "おかえり。出所祝いだ。",
